I believe this should be

```suggestion
                var firstObject = drawables.FirstOrDefault(IsFirstHideableObject);
```

or, probably better, rewrite this logic a bit to be

```csharp
if (IncreaseFirstObjectVisibility.Value)
{
    drawables = drawables.SkipWhile(h => !IsFirstHideableObject(h));

    var firstObject = drawables.FirstOrDefault();
    if (firstObject != null)
        firstObject.ApplyCustomUpdateState += ApplyFirstObjectIncreaseVisibilityState;

    drawables = drawables.Skip(1);
}
```

Can be tested on any map that starts with a spinner - the second object won't fade out at all while the third will work like normal hidden.
